anchor='<template><aside v-if="context" class="support-launcher" aria-label="Soporte y avisos">'
banner='''\n <section v-if="urgentTotal" class="support-urgent-banner" role="alert"><strong>{{urgentTotal}} {{urgentTotal===1?'ticket urgente pendiente de aceptar':'tickets urgentes pendientes de aceptar'}}</strong><p v-if="urgentTickets.length">{{urgentTickets[0].code}} · {{urgentTickets[0].subject}}</p><small>El aviso se repite cada minuto hasta aceptar la atención. Cerrar un mensaje no acepta el ticket.</small><div><button v-if="urgentTickets.length && (!urgentTickets[0].technician_id || Number(urgentTickets[0].technician_id)===Number(context.principal))" type="button" :disabled="alertAccepting" @click="acceptUrgent">{{alertAccepting?'Aceptando…':'Aceptar ticket'}}</button><button type="button" @click="openTicket(urgentTickets[0].ticket_id)">Ver ticket</button><button type="button" @click="toggleSound">{{soundEnabled?'Silenciar sonido y voz':'Activar sonido y voz'}}</button></div><p v-if="error">{{error}}</p></section>'''
